tests/system/accept/metal_accept.sh: a reset before the session is tried again after a second
tests/system/accept/su_command.sh: a reset before the session is tried again after a second
tests/host/etude_watchdog_hosttest.c: a heartbeat every 20 ms, which is no progress
tests/host/etude_watchdog_hosttest.c: progress every 20 ms, which the case's bound must end
tests/host/etude_sched_hosttest.c: a job holds its claims so the workers' claims overlap
tests/timeprobe.c: naps between looks; the parent's are the sleep tested
tests/pipeprobe.c: a try that changed the heap is followed by a pause
tests/host/etude_native_hosttest.c: a process or a group is looked at again every 20 ms
tests/host/etude_legacyset_hosttest.c: the record is read again every 50 ms
tests/host/etude_exec_hosttest.c: the child is checked every 1 ms
tests/host/etude_ports_hosttest.c: a run is looked at again, or watched while it must wait
tests/system/accept/agents_accept.sh: the reopened conversation is read every two seconds
